---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Mahindra Rivenza 2 BHK Flats | Floor Plans & Price Mahalunge"
  description="Explore official 2 BHK luxury flats at Mahindra Rivenza by Mahindra Lifespaces at Baner Annex, Mahalunge, Pune. 635 to 747 sq.ft. RERA carpet area, starting ₹90 Lakhs*. MahaRERA PR1261012602102 & PM1261012602103."
  keywords="mahindra rivenza 2 bhk, mahindra rivenza 2 bhk price, mahindra rivenza 2 bhk floor plan, mahindra rivenza 2 bhk carpet area, mahindra rivenza mahalunge 2 bhk, flats in mahalunge pune 2 bhk, 2 bhk baner annex"
  canonical="https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/residences/2-bhk/"
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 bg-charcoal-950 border-b border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded bg-gold-500/10 border border-gold-500/30 text-gold-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
        <span>Officially Launched Configuration</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-stone-100 max-w-4xl leading-tight">
        2 BHK Luxury Residences: <br />
        <span class="gold-gradient-text">Thoughtful Ergonomics at Mahindra Rivenza</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl font-light leading-relaxed">
        Curated across 4 distinct typologies (Premium, Luxury B, Luxury A, and Ultra Luxury E) ranging from 635 to 747 sq.ft. RERA carpet area (688 to 855 sq.ft. aggregate) with starting price from ₹90 Lakhs*.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Specs Grid -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-charcoal-900 border-b border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-center">
        <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gold-400">635 - 747 sq.ft.</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">RERA Carpet Area Range</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-stone-100">688 - 855 sq.ft.</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Aggregate Usable Area</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gold-400">From ₹90 Lakhs*</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Launch Starting Price</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-emerald-400">Bookings Open</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Phase 1 Priority Allotment</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Blueprint & Highlights -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-charcoal-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
      
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-charcoal-900 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-6 shadow-2xl">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-400 font-bold mb-3">Blueprint Concept Representation</div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 600 420" class="w-full h-auto text-stone-300">
            <rect x="20" y="20" width="560" height="380" fill="#12151a" stroke="#c5a368" stroke-width="2" rx="4"/>
            <rect x="40" y="40" width="280" height="190" fill="#1b2028" stroke="#333d4b" stroke-dasharray="3,3"/>
            <text x="180" y="125" fill="#e5e3dc" font-family="Cinzel" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle">LIVING & DINING</text>
            <text x="180" y="145" fill="#9ca3af" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">18'0" × 12'0"</text>
            <rect x="320" y="40" width="100" height="120" fill="#1f2732" stroke="#c5a368" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="370" y="95" fill="#c5a368" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">BALCONY DECK</text>
            <rect x="40" y="240" width="220" height="140" fill="#1b2028" stroke="#333d4b"/>
            <text x="150" y="305" fill="#e5e3dc" font-family="Cinzel" font-size="13" text-anchor="middle">MASTER SUITE</text>
            <rect x="280" y="180" width="280" height="150" fill="#1b2028" stroke="#333d4b"/>
            <text x="420" y="250" fill="#e5e3dc" font-family="Cinzel" font-size="13" text-anchor="middle">BEDROOM 02</text>
            <circle cx="530" cy="360" r="20" fill="#111317" stroke="#c5a368"/>
            <text x="530" y="355" fill="#c5a368" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">▲</text>
            <text x="530" y="370" fill="#c5a368" font-size="9" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">N</text>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-100 font-bold">2 BHK Typologies Breakdown</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
          <div class="p-3 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
            <div class="font-bold text-gold-400">2 BHK Premium</div>
            <div class="text-stone-300 mt-1">635 sq.ft. RERA</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-400">688 sq.ft. Aggregate</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
            <div class="font-bold text-gold-400">2 BHK Luxury B</div>
            <div class="text-stone-300 mt-1">718 sq.ft. RERA</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-400">785 sq.ft. Aggregate</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
            <div class="font-bold text-gold-400">2 BHK Luxury A</div>
            <div class="text-stone-300 mt-1">736 sq.ft. RERA</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-400">824 sq.ft. Aggregate</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
            <div class="font-bold text-gold-400">2 BHK Ultra Luxury E</div>
            <div class="text-stone-300 mt-1">747 sq.ft. RERA</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-400">855 sq.ft. Aggregate</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h4 class="font-serif text-lg text-stone-100 font-bold">Key Architectural Advantages</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-stone-300">
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✦</span>
            <span>Zero dead-space corridor layout maximizing usable carpet efficiency.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✦</span>
            <span>Parallel chef kitchen with separated utility balcony and service dry area.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✦</span>
            <span>Continuous cross-ventilation channeling cool breezes from Sahyadri hills.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✦</span>
            <span>Dedicated entry foyer protecting family living room privacy.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <button
            data-open-modal
            data-unit="2 BHK All Typologies"
            data-interest="2 BHK Cost Sheet Request"
            class="btn-shimmer flex-1 py-3 px-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-400 to-gold-500 text-charcoal-950 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hover:shadow-xl transition-all"
          >
            Get 2 BHK Cost Sheet
          </button>
          <button
            data-open-modal
            data-interest="2 BHK Floor Plan PDF"
            class="py-3 px-4 rounded-xl border border-white/20 hover:border-gold-400/60 bg-white/5 text-stone-200 hover:text-white text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-all"
          >
            Download 2 BHK Floor Plans PDF
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 13.46-Acre Master Layout Context -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-charcoal-900 border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-2">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-400 font-bold">Township Layout</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-stone-100 font-bold">2 BHK Towers Position in Master Layout</h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300">
          Inspect how the 2 BHK residential towers are positioned relative to the ~44,000 sq.ft clubhouse, central greens, and arterial road.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-charcoal-950 border border-white/10">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-xs text-stone-300">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/5 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-gold-400 text-sm">Zone 02: Phase 1 High-Rise Towers</div>
            <p>Phase 1 features 6 high-rise towers (G+30 to 37 storeys) with only 4 units per floor, high-speed passenger elevators, and panoramic hill views.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/5 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-gold-400 text-sm">Direct Clubhouse Proximity</div>
            <p>Immediate pedestrian boardwalk connectivity to the ~44,000 sq.ft grand clubhouse, resort swimming pool with sunken bar, and badminton courts.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/5 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-gold-400 text-sm">9+ Acres Vehicular-Free Greens</div>
            <p>All vehicular movement is routed through the peripheral ring road, ensuring 100% vehicle-free central green courtyards outside your living room.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
